@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@categoryId = 1

### Create category (201); generated ID is reused below
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"api-category-{{$timestamp}}","description":"API test category"}
> {% client.global.set("categoryId", response.body.id); %}

### List categories (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### Read category (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}

### Update category (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"updated-category-{{$timestamp}}","description":"Updated category"}

### Create without optional description (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"no-description-{{$timestamp}}"}

### Blank required name (400, INVALID_REQUEST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":" "}

### Missing category (404, CATEGORY_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/999999999

### Delete category (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
